    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55534" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφορ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>violent, vehement</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφοδρὸς καὶ κ. λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Grg.</u>
					p.370
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλαβῶς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lethargic, somnolent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Dent.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <i>causing lethargy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύξεις,
				νοσήματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.161
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				162
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>by evacuation</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
